cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgentSUMO in academic work, please cite the paper listed under `preferred-citation`."
title: "AgentSUMO: An Agentic Framework for Interactive Simulation Scenario Generation in SUMO via Large Language Models"
abstract: >-
  AgentSUMO is an LLM-guided agentic framework that lets non-expert
  stakeholders design, execute, and analyze SUMO traffic simulations
  through natural-language interaction. A Planner Agent governed by
  an Interactive Planning Protocol translates underspecified policy
  objectives into validated simulation plans, drives them via the
  Model Context Protocol (MCP), and surfaces results through a web
  dashboard backed by a queryable SQLite store.
